WEBVTT

00:01:58.036 --> 00:02:04.196
and also the fact that warm relationships
seemed to keep people

00:02:04.196 --> 00:02:08.836
both physically stronger
and kept their brains sharper

00:02:08.836 --> 00:02:10.356
as they grew older.

00:02:11.516 --> 00:02:14.476
And we didn't believe the data at first.

00:02:14.516 --> 00:02:16.396
We thought, how could this be

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:20.036
that relationships actually
get into our bodies

00:02:20.076 --> 00:02:21.596
and shape our health?

00:02:22.836 --> 00:02:25.716
But then other studies
began to find the same thing.

00:02:26.356 --> 00:02:28.756
We found that people had less depression,

00:02:28.796 --> 00:02:32.196
they were less likely to get
diabetes and heart disease,